## Key Insights dari Analisa Data (2026-08-06)

### 1. Primary Key: No. Pesanan (100% Reliable)
- **Format:** `YYMMDD[A-Z0-9]{8-10}`
- **Coverage:** Semua report punya No. Pesanan sebagai identifier
- **Consistency:** 100% match across Balance, Income, dan Order.all

### 2. Data Relationship (Validated)

**Core Data (679 pesanan dengan dana dilepas):**
```
Balance Report (679) = Income Seller Fee (679) = Order.all (679)
100% MATCH ✓✓✓
```

**Problem Orders:**
```
Failed Delivery:  27 pesanan (100% validated)
Return/Refund:    12 pesanan (91.7% ada di Balance)
Cancellation:    205 pesanan (belum dianalisa detail)
```

### 3. Balance Report Transaction Types

| Tipe Transaksi | Count | % | No. Pesanan Location |
|----------------|-------|---|---------------------|
| Penghasilan dari Pesanan | 679 | 78.8% | Col 4 (No. Pesanan) |
| Isi Ulang Saldo Iklan | 145 | 16.8% | - (bukan order) |
| Penarikan Dana | 10 | 1.2% | - (withdraw) |
