### 7. Database Schema (Recommended)

**Core Tables:**
1. `orders` - dari Order.all (1,947 orders)
2. `balance_transactions` - dari Balance Report (679 orders)
3. `seller_fees` - dari Income Seller Fee (679 orders)
4. `profit_calculation` - calculated (Net Payout - HPP - Packaging)

**Join Strategy:**
```sql
orders (no_pesanan)
  LEFT JOIN balance_transactions USING (no_pesanan)
  LEFT JOIN seller_fees USING (no_pesanan)
  LEFT JOIN profit_calculation USING (no_pesanan)
```

